        "en": "Mixed feedback on veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients praise the friendly receptionists and helpful vets like Simon and Nicki for their reassuring consultations and attentive pet care. However, several pet owners describe frustrating interactions with senior management and front desk staff, citing rude remarks and inflexible attitudes during appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Concerns regarding consultation communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A number of clients express frustration with communication at the front desk and during consultations, citing condescending exchanges and arguments over policies. While some owners appreciate clear phone advice and prompt follow-up updates, negative experiences regarding staff tone remain a notable concern."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Handling of dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners frequently highlight compassionate handling during difficult procedures and euthanasia, noting that staff provided comfort and dignity for pets. Conversely, a few reviewers felt examinations were overly forceful with anxious pets or reported stress following routine treatments like nail clipping."
      }
    }
  ],
